---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { withBase } from '../config';
import now from '../data/now.json';
---
<BaseLayout title="3am" description="you weren't supposed to find this one.">
  <section class="secret shell-narrow">
    <p class="eyebrow">unlisted / 00</p>
    <h1>oh. you actually clicked it.</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      congrats, you found the page i don't link from the nav. it's just me, this font, and whatever i was
      listening to when i last touched the site — <strong>{now.track}</strong> by {now.artist}.
    </p>
    <pre style="border:1px solid var(--line);padding:18px;color:var(--muted);font-size:11px;overflow-x:auto">root@maya:~$ cat .confessions
- i have 41 browser tabs open and i'm attached to all of them
- i've read the HTTP spec for fun. multiple times. on purpose.
- i've bought the same book twice because i forgot i owned it. twice.
- every hard problem gets solved outside with a cigarette, not at the desk
- i'd trade a whole weekend for one good cold sunset and a hot drink</pre>
    <div class="actions">
      <a class="button" href={withBase('/')}>back to the normal internet</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
